The only change the visual editor needs in an existing upstream file.
The root preference set of the YouTube settings patch is private, so another patch
can't put an entry at the top of Morphe settings. This adds a small accessor.

--- a/patches/src/main/kotlin/app/morphe/patches/youtube/misc/settings/SettingsPatch.kt
+++ b/patches/src/main/kotlin/app/morphe/patches/youtube/misc/settings/SettingsPatch.kt
@@
 private val preferences = mutableSetOf<BasePreference>()

+/**
+ * Adds a preference to the root of the Morphe settings screen (where About is).
+ * Must be called from a patch's execute block that depends on [settingsPatch].
+ */
+internal fun addRootPreference(preference: BasePreference) {
+    preferences += preference
+}
+
 private val settingsResourcePatch = patch {

